DEC  VT100  terminals  with some extensions introduced by the DEC
VT220 and DEC VT320 models.  The features of the  original  VT100
which  are  not  or not completely implemented are: VT52 support,
132‐column‐mode, smooth scroll, light  background,  keyboard  au‐
torepeat  control,  external  printer  support, keyboard locking,
newline/linefeed switching: Escape  sequences  related  to  these
features are ignored or answered with standard replies.  (DECANM,
