Function keys are not reprogrammable and fonts can not  be  down‐
loaded.  DECUDK and DECDLD sequences will be ignored.  Neither C1
control set characters will be recognized nor will 8‐bit keyboard
codes  be delivered.  The font is approximated by the ISO‐latin‐1
font, though there are subtle differences.  The actual  rendering
quality  depends  on  the  underlying  graphics  hardware driver.
